Support outreach activities including tours, class visits, and workshops;
Process archival and library materials; and
Perform any other duties as assigned.
Requirements:
Applicants should possess at least a recognised Higher Diploma / Associate degree, a recognised university degree or equivalent qualification in Library and Information Studies is preferred;
Prior experience in a research or library setting will be an advantage;
Good command of both written and spoken English and Chinese (Cantonese and Putonghua);
Service-oriented mindset, strong attention to detail, excellent communication skills, and solid computer proficiency;
Ability to work independently and collaboratively as part of a team; and
Shortlisted candidates will be invited to complete a written test.
